<title>UK: Henry Boot H1 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Henry Boot H1 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.8		    vs 7.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.10		   vs 1.95</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.94		   vs 2.71</p>
<p> Turnover		   75.54		  vs 86.73</p>
<p> Tax			  0.91		   vs 0.85</p>
<p> Attributable	     2.03		   vs 1.86</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Henry Boot &amp; Sons Plc.</p>
</text>
